This package is a NarraFork plugin. It bundles no third-party runtime libraries: the
UI is a single IIFE plus one CSS file, built from the sources in this repository.

Interaction ideas (turn grouping, duration display, collapsible detail, keeping
terminal state on screen) are inspired by DeepSeek Harness-style run timelines. No
DeepSeek source code or UI assets are included.

NarraFork host API contract used by this plugin (verified against NarraFork 0.9.1):
  protocol: narrafork.ui/1
  query:    narrafork.narrator.messages.list
  events:   narrafork.narrator.{tool.changed,message.changed,lifecycle,attention,permission.changed}
            narrafork.events.resync_required
  storage:  plugin storage, narrator scope
